<report>
<title>False result probabilities</title>

<p>For an overall case rate of <in>population</in> per ten thousand population tested:</p>

<p>Test SENSITIVITY = <inu>sensitive</inu>%<br />
Probability of a FALSE POSITIVE result = <pval><inu>positive</inu></pval></p>

<p>Test SPECIFICITY = <inu>specific</inu>%<br />
Probability of a FALSE NEGATIVE result = <pval><inu>negative</inu></pval></p>
</report>
